Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:46:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] v8: kFlyWebCacheEpoch 37 -> 38 for FlyWeb 3.2.0

The 3.2.0 changes V8 twice on top of 3.1.4: the 8078 branch fix
d68cecd900 (softmac seguridad/pendiente/brave-core/0001, which changes
optimized code and leaves the epoch to whoever integrates it) and
LIBC_MATH in base/ieee754.cc (renderer-webgl 0003, which changes the
Math builtins). One epoch for the whole release, so code cached by
3.1.4 is not reused.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwmK2hjxRPyuefYzGRoZRk
